   "fill": "gray",
   "text": "Handoff map\n\nMain.dc.html = the page, hub state. Factory.dc.html = same page, factory state (night). Phone.dc.html = 390px layout. World.dc.html = the engine (child component mounted by all three; `still` prop renders one pre-simulated frame = the reduced-motion path).\n\nEverything else lives on the Explorations page.",
   "w": 420,
